d nodes and trusted job definitions.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/doc_9461.md","start_line":157,"end_line":190}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-a92bca9761c14bfc9c408dfcf16bf8f0","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.89,"location":{"file":"references/doc_9521.md","start_line":13,"end_line":16},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file documents a command that pauses recovery processing and allows source nodes to continue writing data, which can affect system integrity and recovery state. The text explains what the command does and who can run it, but it does not include any cautionary warning about potential operational consequences or the need to verify cluster state before use.","remediation":"Add an explicit warning section stating that suspending recovery can affect availability, recovery timelines, and cluster consistency expectations, and recommend that administrators confirm intent and assess impact before running the command.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/doc_9521.md","start_line":13,"end_line":16}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-853e00f5979145aebc03d6c49b235d3e","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.91,"location":{"file":"references/doc_9558.md","start_line":13,"end_line":15},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file documents a command that stops asynchronous replication between clusters, which can affect data movement and system integrity. The description states what the command does, but it does not include any cautionary warning about service impact, replication lag, or administrative risk before use.","remediation":"Add a clear warning near the command description and example stating that this operation interrupts cluster replication, should be used only by authorized administrators, and may affec